=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
# runall screen-ubuntu2604 -------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Mock: Run All. web-01.example.net runs Ubuntu 26.04. As the$
# VM: ssh.socket, prohibit-password, ufw allowing 22,$
# unattended-upgrades on. hardn.yml: george with a key, port 22,$
# two nameservers, backups on, and enableUnattendedUpgrades,$
# enableUfwSshPolicy, configureDns and disableRootSSH true.$
$
# Run All ######################################################$
$
# Controls -----------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  User                 Already as asked$
   -  Firewall             Already as asked$
   -  SSH Login            Root login off$
   -  SSH Auth             Nothing asked$
   -  SSH Port             Already as asked$
   -  AppArmor             Status only$
   -  Auto Updates         Already as asked$
   -  DNS                  Set 2 nameservers$
   -  Backups              Used, not changed$
   -  Environment          Nothing asked$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Apply all            Plan, review, confirm$
                           [ ] Lockout risk$
$
   0) Return$
$
  > Enter your choice [0-1 or q]:$
$
$

